<title>USA: Southern again shuts Farley 2 during restart.</title>
<headline>Southern again shuts Farley 2 during restart.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Southern Co's Southern Nuclear Operating Co manually tripped its 822 megawatt (MW) Farley 2 nuclear power plant this weekend, scuttling restart operations, the U.S. Nuclear Regulatory Commission (NRC) said Monday.</p>
</text>
